    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.1",
      "source_sha256": "282d6c58666a9ff6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "The elder, to the beloved Gaius, whom I love in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.2",
      "source_sha256": "7a22bd08ae3a3d7b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Beloved, in all things I pray that you may prosper, just as your soul prospers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.3",
      "source_sha256": "afce16347b80f417",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "For I rejoiced greatly at the brothers who came and testified to your truth, how you walk in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.4",
      "source_sha256": "7b2077638b609904",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I have no other joy greater than this: to hear that my children walk in truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.5",
      "source_sha256": "d88927c2fc890b06",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Beloved, you act faithfully in what you do for the brothers, and this for strangers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.6",
      "source_sha256": "4a2c8ed24f05bf1d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "They have testified to your love before the church. You do well to send them on their way in a manner worthy of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.7",
      "source_sha256": "d60b1710fce00442",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "For they went out for the sake of the name of Christ and took nothing from the gentiles."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.8",
      "source_sha256": "38b3ed8dc0e43a26",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Therefore we ought to receive such people, so that we may be fellow helpers of the truth."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.9",
      "source_sha256": "89ca7ab7b5fc433c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I wrote to the church, but Diotrephes, who loves to have the first place among them, does not receive us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.10",
      "source_sha256": "bc81a369092c7741",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Therefore, if I come, I will call to his attention the deeds he does: he slanders us with evil words. And this is not enough for him; he himself does not receive the brothers either, and those who want to receive them he hinders and casts out of the congregation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.11",
      "source_sha256": "a057d1264092dc0b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Beloved, do not imitate what is evil, but what is good. For whoever does good is from God, but whoever does evil has not seen God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.12",
      "source_sha256": "4ac3f128d3ac7523",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Demetrius has testimony from everyone, and from the truth itself. We also testify, and you know that our testimony is true."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.13",
      "source_sha256": "c5af58d7e0b12b32",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I have much to write to you, but I do not wish to write to you with ink and pen."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.14",
      "source_sha256": "37b9f33e4b3f94a2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "I hope to see you soon, and we will speak face to face."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-catholic-a1/3john#3John.1.15",
      "source_sha256": "ef35667d19fd7471",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 15,
      "text": "Peace to you! The friends greet you. Greet our friends by name."
    }
  ]
}
